"Taeol scried across dimensions and built a summoning from his dimensional research."
"He means to trade magic for the scientific secrets of a world beyond Davrar."
"In this season's opening week he summons Nathan Lark, an Earth scientist, into his tower."
"He forces his tongue into Nathan's mind and tries to purge Nathan's memory."
"He threatens to put Nathan's soul in a golem core, and blows off Nathan's arm with [Disintegrate]."
"Nathan breaks Taeol's nose and knee, and Taeol teleports away as Nathan escapes."
"Later, having lost Nathan, he falls to Ninth Finger and Fourth Researcher, low at the council table."
"Later, Badud offers him [Mass Teleport] Insights to capture Nathan."
"Later, he hires a team of Gemore Adventurers to kidnap Nathan, and they fail."
"Later, Badud sets him and Nathan up as rivals, and days after, Nathan kills him."
